fcpi patch 0004: auxiliary downloads through the retrieval service
Upstream 7666c1f9. downloadFile.ts (fetchFileToBuffer, downloadFile) and lib/validateUrl.ts resolveRedirects
use the retrieval service's /internal/fetch in the pi-resilient profile; both sitemap gunzips are bounded at
the sitemap protocol's 50 MB.

